{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn4le06ob08re2img04.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Guide</span> : J\u00e9r\u00f4me, j'aimerais te pr\u00e9senter nos randonneurs. Aimerais-tu leur parler des changements r\u00e9cents dans ta communaut\u00e9 ?  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">J\u00e9r\u00f4me</span> : Oui, j'aimerais bien. Nous avons chang\u00e9 notre style de vie \u00e0 cause des effets pervers de la d\u00e9forestation. <br/>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "frn4le06ob08re2img04.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Randonneuse</span> : La communaut\u00e9 a compl\u00e8tement chang\u00e9 sa fa\u00e7on de vivre, n'est-ce pas&nbsp;? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">J\u00e9r\u00f4me</span> : Exactement. Beaucoup d'animaux ont quitt\u00e9 la r\u00e9gion \u00e0 cause de la d\u00e9sertification. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>:  Parle-nous du projet, J\u00e9r\u00f4me.", "id": 2, "time": "11500", "image": "frn4le06ob08re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">J\u00e9r\u00f4me</span> : D'accord. Nous avons d\u00e9cid\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er notre propre marque de produits naturels car nous savions depuis longtemps quelles plantes de la for\u00eat \u00e9taient hydratantes pour la peau et pour les cheveux. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span> : Quelle id\u00e9e fantastique, n'est-ce pas ?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">J\u00e9r\u00f4me</span> : Nos produits sont 100 % naturels parce qu'ils sont faits sans produits chimiques ni ingr\u00e9dients artificiels. De plus, ils ont des ar\u00f4mes exotiques qui rappellent la for\u00eat.", "id": 3, "time": "22500", "image": "frn4le06ob08re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Randonneuse</span> : Votre communaut\u00e9 a maintenant de l'espoir pour l'avenir.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">J\u00e9r\u00f4me</span> : C'est vrai. Si vous voulez, votre groupe pourrait visiter l'entrep\u00f4t demain puisque nous pr\u00e9parons l'envoi d'une grande cargaison. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span> : Ce serait super. Merci pour l'invitation.  <br>", "id": 4, "time": "41500", "image": "frn4le06ob08re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn4le06ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le06ob08re2img04.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<ul><li>Cause \u00e0 effet</li></ul>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img02.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 2, "time": "4500", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img03.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 3, "time": "5750", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img04.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 4, "time": "6750", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img05.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 5, "time": "8000", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img06.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 6, "time": "9000", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<ul><li>Exemples</li></ul>", "id": 7, "time": "15000", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<ul><li>\u00c0 rappeler</li></ul>", "id": 8, "time": "73500", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img08.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 9, "time": "87500", "image": "frn4le06ob08re3img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn4le06ob08re3aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le06ob08re3img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "J